<title>INDIA: India's Tube says damaged bikes insured.</title>
<headline>India's Tube says damaged bikes insured.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tube Investments of India Ltd said on Friday that 4,300 bicycles damaged by a fire at a factory owned by its TI Cycles unit were insured.</p>
<p>The fire broke out on Wednesday at the factory in the southern state of Tamil Nadu, causing an estimated loss of 10 million rupees, Tube Investments had said on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;The stocks have been adequately insured,&quot; Tube Investments said in a statement released on Friday.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
